    <briefdescription>
<para>SET(...) - Create a set (unique values array). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates an array with unique values only.</para>
<para>Examples: SET(1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3) =&gt; [1, 2, 3] SET(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;a&quot;) =&gt; [&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;] SET([1, 2, 2, 3]) =&gt; [1, 2, 3] </para>
    </detaileddescription>
